#萤石SDK太老出现编译问题系统库libarclite在Xcode15以上已经废弃，ios13 以上跑 ios 12 一下SDK 编译报错，SDK does not contain 'libarclite' at the path '/Applications/Xcode_26.2.app/Contents/Developer/Toolchains/XcodeDefault.xctoolchain/usr/lib/arc/libarclite_iphoneos.a'; try increasing the minimum deployment target 在下边添加 config.build_settings['IPHONEOS_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET'] = '12.0'

post_install do |installer|
  installer.pods_project.targets.each do |target|
    target.build_configurations.each do |config|
      config.build_settings['IPHONEOS_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET'] = '12.0'
      # 关闭Bitcode
      config.build_settings['ENABLE_BITCODE'] = 'NO'
      # 可选：指定有效架构（避免其他编译问题）
      config.build_settings['VALID_ARCHS'] = 'arm64 x86_64'
    end
  end
end
